        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Schlage Rhodes Grade 1 Commercial Door Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis easy-to-grip Schlage Rhodes Lever is designed for commercial, institutional, and industrial use in facilities such as schools, hospitals, and factories where a long life of dependable operation must be combined with a high degree of resistance to physical abuse. This lever is durable with a 7-year mechanical warranty and an ANSI Grade 1 rating. It is UL fire rated for a 3 hour fire door. The door thickness rage is 1-5/8\" to 2-1/8\"; and the available backsets include 2-3/8\", 2-3/4\", 3-3/4\", and 5\". \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Schlage Rhodes ND-Series Door Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Meets BHMA standards at 3,000,000 cycles.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>ANSI A156.2-2003, Series 4000 Grade 1.</li>\r\n<li>UL fire rated for 3 hour fire door.</li>\r\n<li>Keyed functions with 6-pin, C123 keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Comes Packaged with two keys per lock.</li>\r\n<li>7-year mechanical warranty for all functions.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Rhodes Schlage Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-5/8\" to 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Available backsets are 2-3/4\" (70 mm), 2-3/8\" (60 mm), 3-3/4\" (95 mm) and 5\" (127 mm).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-latching and non-locking. Used for one side of door as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (ANSI F75):</b> Latching only, both levers always unlocked.</li>\r\n<li><b>Exit Lock (ANSI F89):</b> Outside lever is always fixed (no entry from outside). Inside lever always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (ANSI F76):</b> Locked by the use of a push-button located on the inside lever. Outside emergency unlocking with screwdriver (not included). Turning inside lever or closing door releases button. Inside lever is alway free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Classroom Lock (ANSI F84):</b> Outside lever locked and unlocked by key. Inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Entrance Lock (ANSI F109):</b> Pushing and turning the button on the inside lever locks outside lever. The use of key to enter from the outside is required until button is manually unlocked. On the other hand, just pushing the button on the inside lever and not turning it, locks the outside lever until it is unlocked by a key from the exterior or by turning the inside lever. Inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n<li><b>Storeroom Lock (ANSI F86):</b> The outside lever is fixed. Entrance from the outside is done only by the use of a key. The inside lever is always unlocked and free for immediate egress.</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rhodes Grade 1 Commercial Lever, Schlage ND-RHO",
                "description": "Schlage ND-Series Rhodes Commercial Lever Lock ND-RHO - This easy-to-grip Schlage Rhodes Lever is designed for commercial, institutional, and industrial use in facilities such as schools, hospitals, and factories where a long life of dependable operation must be combined with a high degree of resistance to physical abuse. This lever is durable with a 7-year mechanical warranty and an ANSI Grade 1 rating. It is UL fire rated for a 3 hour fire door. The door thickness rage is 1-5/8 inches to 2-1/8 inches; and the available backsets include 2-3/8 inches, 2-3/4 inches, 3-3/4 inches, and 5 inches. ",
                "keywords": "Schlage Rhodes levers, schlage ND-Series, ND-Locks, Schlage Rhodes commercial levers, Rhodes Commercial Lever Locks, schlage heavy duty locks, SCH-ND-rho, ul fired rated door levers, grade 1 door hardware, Rhodes schlage levers,  schlage nd rho, ND10S RHO 626, Schlage Rhodes Commercial Levers,"
